#. ja: 「<string $s1>」の表示サイズを『<switch $n2><case>小<case>中<case>大</switch>』に変更しました。
#. de: Die Bestie ist jetzt <switch $n2><case>klein<case>mittelgroß<case>groß</switch>.
#. fr: Vous avez réglé la taille d'affichage de votre <string $s1> sur “<switch $n2><case>petite<case>moyenne<case>grande</switch>”.
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>small<case>medium<case>large</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5100:0:5"
msgid "Size of your <string $s1> set to <switch $n2><case>small<case>medium<case>large</switch>."
msgstr "Размер отображения «<string $s1>» изменён на «<switch $n2><case>маленький<case>средний<case>большой</switch>»."

#. ja: 「魔獣使いのすべてのペット」の表示サイズを『<switch $n1><case>小<case>中<case>大</switch>』に変更しました。
#. de: Alle Bestien sind jetzt <switch $n1><case>klein<case>mittelgroß<case>groß</switch>.
#. fr: Vous avez réglé la taille d'affichage de toutes vos bêtes sur “<switch $n1><case>petite<case>moyenne<case>grande</switch>”.
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>small<case>medium<case>large</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5101:0:5"
msgid "Size of all familiars set to <switch $n1><case>small<case>medium<case>large</switch>."
msgstr "Размер отображения всех питомцев изменён на «<switch $n1><case>маленький<case>средний<case>большой</switch>»."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<if ($n2 <= 1)><sheet Item $n1 0><else><sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2></if>にロットした。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>würfelst<else>würfelt</if> um <if ($n2 <= 1)><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1><else><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1></if>.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>lancez vos<else>lance ses</if> dés pour <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1><else>les <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>cast your<else><if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">casts her<else>casts his</if><else><if $gn5>casts her<else>casts his</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">casts her<else>casts his</if><else><if $gn5>casts her<else>casts his</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">casts her<else>casts his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet BNpcName $gn7 6> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = BNpcName, row = global number 7, column = 6 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn5>casts her<else>casts his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else>the <num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5180:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>cast your<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">casts her<else>casts his</if><else><if $gn5>casts her<else>casts his</if></if></if> lot for <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else>the <num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></if>."
msgstr "<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы бросили кубики за<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> <if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">бросила<else>бросил</if><else><if $gn5>бросила<else>бросил</if></if> кубики за</if> <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></if>."

#. ja: ロットルールが<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「マスタールート」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>に設定されています。
#. de: Die Beuteregel ist „<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Anführer</ui-edge-color></ui-color>“.
#. fr: La règle du butin est maintenant “<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>maître du butin</ui-edge-color></ui-color>”.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
