msgctxt "LogMessage:5181:0:5"
msgid "The party loot rule has been set to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Lootmaster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Правило распределения добычи изменено на <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Мастер добычи»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: ロットルールが<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「GREED限定」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>に設定されています。
#. de: Die Beuteregel ist „<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Nur Gier</ui-edge-color></ui-color>“.
#. fr: La règle du butin est maintenant “<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>juste cupidité</ui-edge-color></ui-color>”.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5182:0:5"
msgid "The party loot rule has been set to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Greed Only</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Правило распределения добычи изменено на <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Только жадность»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: <if ($n2 <= 1)><sheet Item $n1 0><else><sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2></if>が戦利品に追加されました。<if ($n3 == 1)>（リミテッドタイムボーナス効果発動！）</if>
#. de: <if ($n3 == 1)>Kurzzeitbonus! </if><capitalize><if ($n2 <= 1)><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1> wurde<else><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 1 1> wurden</if></capitalize> dem Beutegut hinzugefügt.
#. fr: <if ($n2 == 1)><capitalize><noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> a<else><num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1> ont</if> été ajouté<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if><if ($n2 == 1)><else>s</if> au butin. <if ($n3 == 1)>(Bonus obtenu<nbsp>!)</if>
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> has<else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> have</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 == 1)> (Limited-time bonus activated!)</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5183:0:5"
msgid "<if ($n2 == 1)><capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> has<else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> have</if> been added to the loot list.<if ($n3 == 1)> (Limited-time bonus activated!)</if>"
msgstr "<if ($n2 == 1)><capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize> добавлен<else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> добавлены</if> в список добычи.<if ($n3 == 1)> Активирован бонус за ограниченное время!</if>"

