#. macro: <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet BNpcName $gn7 6> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = BNpcName, row = global number 7, column = 6 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn5>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5196:0:5"
msgid "Unable to designate <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>yourself<else><if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if></if> recipient of an untradable/unsellable item already in <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>your<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> possession."
msgstr "Нельзя назначить <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>себя<else><if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if></if> получателем предмета, который уже есть в <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>вашем<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">её<else>его</if><else><if $gn5>её<else>его</if></if></if> инвентаре, если предмет привязан и его нельзя продать."

#. ja: 中毒防止制限中のため、<if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>へ分配できません。
#. de: Diese Aktion ist vor<shy>über<shy>gehend nicht möglich.<br>Dies ist eine Maßnahme zur Suchtprävention.
#. fr: Impossible d'attribuer à <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if> du fait de mesures anti-accoutumance.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5197:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> can't have this item because reasons."
msgstr "<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> не можете получить этот предмет."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<if ($n2 <= 1)><sheet Item $n1 0><else><sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2></if>にロットする権利がないため分配できません。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>bist<else>ist</if> nicht berechtigt, um  <if ($n2 <= 1)><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1><else><noun-de Item 2 $n1 2 4 1></if> zu würfeln,<br>daher ist die Zuteilung nicht möglich.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> n'<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>avez<else>a</if> pas le droit de jeter les dés pour <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1><else>les <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></if> et ne <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>pouvez<else>peut</if> donc pas se voir attribuer ce butin.
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>yourself<else><if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet ObjStr $gn7 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ObjStr, row = global number 7, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else>the <num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>You<else><if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">She<else>He</if><else><if $gn5>She<else>He</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">She<else>He</if><else><if $gn5>She<else>He</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">She<else>He</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet BNpcName $gn7 6> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = BNpcName, row = global number 7, column = 6 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn5>She<else>He</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5198:0:5"
msgid "Unable to designate <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>yourself<else><if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if></if> recipient of <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else>the <num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></if>. <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>You<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">She<else>He</if><else><if $gn5>She<else>He</if></if></if> cannot accept the item."
msgstr "Нельзя назначить получателем <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1></if> для <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>вас<else><if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if></if>. <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">Она<else>Он</if><else><if $gn5>Она<else>Он</if></if></if> не можете принять предмет."

#. ja: 戦利品の表示が上限に達しているため、<br><if ($n2 <= 1)><sheet Item $n1 0><else><sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2></if>に<if ($n4 <= 1)><sheet Item $n3 0><else><sheet Item $n3 0>×<num $n4></if>が上書きされました。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($n2 == 1)><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1> wurde<else><num $n2> <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 1 1> wurden</if></capitalize> mit <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-de Item 1 $n3 1 3 1><else><num $n4> <noun-de Item 5 $n3 2 3 1></if> überschrieben, weil die Beutegut-Liste voll war.
#. fr: La limite d'affichage du butin a été atteinte.<br><if ($n2 <= 1)><capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> a<else>Les <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1> ont</if> été remplacé<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if><if ($n2 <= 1)><else>s</if> par <if ($n4 <= 1)><noun-fr Item 1 $n3 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-fr Item 12 $n3 2 1></if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> has<else>The <num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> have</if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> has<else>The <num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> have</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n4 == 1)><noun-en Item a $n3 1 1><else><num $n4> <noun-en Item 3 $n3 2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 4 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item a $n3 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = a, row = number parameter 3, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
