#. macro: <if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 8 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
