msgctxt "LogMessage:5464:0:5"
msgid "Your next quest objective requires <sheet EventTutorial 7 1>. Your destination will not appear on the map while following. Learn more about this quest objective via the <icon 182> icon in the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Duty List</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
