msgctxt "LogMessage:5621:0:5"
msgid "You promote <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if> to fellowship admin."
msgstr "Вы назначили <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if> администратором сообщества."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>をフェローシップ運営から外しました。
#. de: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> wurden die Administrator-Rechte entzogen.
#. fr: Vous avez retiré le rang de re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant<if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">e</if><else><if $gn5>e</if></if> de la communauté à <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if>.
#. macro: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
