msgid " <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>match<else>matches</if> found. <num $n2> displayed."
msgstr "Найдено <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>совпадение<else>совпадений</if>. Показано: <num $n2>."

#. ja: 該当するアイテムが見つかりませんでした。
#. de: Keine passenden Resultate.
#. fr: Aucun résultat
msgctxt "LogMessage:5693:0:5"
msgid "No matching items."
msgstr "Подходящих предметов не найдено."

#. ja: 呼び出しアクション「<sheet Ornament $n1 8>」を修得した。
#. de: Du hast das Kommando „<sheet Ornament $n1 8>“ freigeschaltet.
#. fr: Vous avez appris l'action <sheet Ornament $n1 8>.
#. macro: <sheet Ornament $n1 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Ornament, row = number parameter 1, column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5701:0:5"
msgid "You acquire the <sheet Ornament $n1 8> personal effect."
msgstr "Вы получили личный эффект «<sheet Ornament $n1 8>»."

#. ja: すでに修得済みです。
#. de: Du hast dieses Kommando bereits freigeschaltet.
#. fr: Vous avez déjà appris cette action.
msgctxt "LogMessage:5702:0:5"
msgid "You have already acquired that personal effect."
msgstr "Этот личный эффект уже получен."

#. ja: この場所で使用することはできません。
#. de: Du kannst dieses Kommando hier nicht ausführen.
#. fr: Cette action ne peut pas être utilisée ici.
msgctxt "LogMessage:5703:0:5"
msgid "You cannot use personal effects in this area."
msgstr "Здесь нельзя использовать личные эффекты."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<sheet Ornament $n1 8>を使用した。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>verwendest<else>verwendet</if> das Accessoire „<sheet Ornament $n1 8>“.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous équipez<else>s'équipe</if> d'un accessoire.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>equip<else>equips</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5705:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>equip<else>equips</if> a personal effect."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы надеваете<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> надевает</if></capitalize> личное украшение."

#. ja: <sheet Ornament $n1 8>を雨天時に自動使用するパラソルとして登録しました。
#. de: Dieser Schirm wird bei Regen automatisch verwendet: <sheet Ornament $n1 8>.
#. fr: Vous avez enregistré “<sheet Ornament $n1 8>” comme accessoire à utiliser au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment par temps de pluie.
#. macro: <sheet Ornament $n1 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Ornament, row = number parameter 1, column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5706:0:5"
msgid "<sheet Ornament $n1 8> selected as auto-umbrella."
msgstr "«<sheet Ornament $n1 8>» выбран в качестве зонта для автоматического использования."

#. ja: <sheet Ornament $n1 8>の自動使用登録を解除しました。
#. de: Dieser Schirm wird nicht mehr automatisch verwendet: <sheet Ornament $n1 8>.
#. fr: Vous avez supprimé “<sheet Ornament $n1 8>” comme accessoire à utiliser au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment par temps de pluie.
#. macro: <sheet Ornament $n1 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Ornament, row = number parameter 1, column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5707:0:5"
msgid "<sheet Ornament $n1 8> deselected as auto-umbrella."
msgstr "«<sheet Ornament $n1 8>» больше не будет использоваться автоматически как зонт."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n2 0>を<num $n1>個手に入れた。
#. de: <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>Traumblatt<else>Traumblätter</if> erhalten.
#. fr: Vous obtenez <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> <noun-fr Item 12 $n2 $n1 1>.
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 $n1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = number parameter 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5751:0:5"
msgid "You obtain <num $n1> <noun-en Item 3 $n2 $n1 1>."
msgstr "Вы получаете <num $n1> <noun-en Item 3 $n2 $n1 1>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>の所持数が上限に達しているため、獲得した<sheet Item $n1 0>は受け取れませんでした。
#. de: Die Vergütung kann nicht entgegengenommen werden, weil du zu viele davon im Besitz hast.
#. fr: Impossible de recevoir l'ensemble <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 2 1>. La limite est atteinte.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5752:0:5"
msgid "You cannot carry any more <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Вы не можете нести больше <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: 強敵との激闘の記憶が蘇った！<br>ソーチョーに報告して、幻想盤に挑戦しましょう！
#. de: Du hast einen beeindruckenden Feind besiegt!<br>Berichte Sotan davon und versuch dein Glück an der Traumtafel.
#. fr: Vous avez triomphé d'un ennemi très coriace<nbsp>! Retournez auprès du “président” pour lui raconter votre exploit et jouer à Touché-tourné<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:5753:0:5"
msgid "You have envisioned a stirring tale of heroism! Regale the faux commander to gain access to Faux Hollows."
msgstr "Вы сочинили захватывающую историю о подвиге! Расскажите о ней Ложному командиру, чтобы открыть доступ к Ложным дуплам."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>をマーケットボードの「ブックマーク」に登録しました。（<num $n2>/<num $n3>）
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> wurde der Merkliste hinzugefügt. (<num $n2>/<num $n3>)
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> a été ajouté<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if> aux favoris du tableau des ventes. (<num $n2>/<num $n3>)
