#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:5756:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> has been added to your market board favorites. (<num $n2>/<num $n3>)"
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> добавлен в избранное доски объявлений. (<num $n2>/<num $n3>)"

#. ja: マーケットボードの「ブックマーク」がいっぱいのため登録できません。
